# The `use` statement (With) follows the syntax `use (preference)

Standing user preference: The `use` statement (With) follows the syntax `use (resource) { suite }` for scoped resource management.

## Conventions
- The `use` statement (With) follows the syntax `use (resource) { suite }` for scoped resource management.

